<title>USA: U.S. Properties buys country club property.</title>
<headline>U.S. Properties buys country club property.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>United States Properties Inc said Thursday it entered into a letter of intent to acquire the balance of the residential development at the HighPoint Country Club in Montague, N.J.</p>
<p>The company is acquiring the remaining 285 residential lots at the country club for $6.5 million in stock, cash and a note.</p>
